Theta arithmetic
================

`prism-isogeny/src/theta.rs` ports the theta-coordinate doubling from
`external/PRISM_v2/src/hd/ref/lvlx/theta_structure.c` and the inline
transforms in `theta_structure.h`.

`prism-isogeny/src/theta_step.rs` and `prism-isogeny/src/splitting.rs` port
the (2,2)-step, the splitting isomorphism, and the product-to-Montgomery
maps from `theta_isogenies.c`, and the splitting-matrix table from
`src/precomp/ref/lvl1/hd_splitting_transforms.c`. The signing-only
normalisation matrices are not included: verification calls splitting with
randomisation off.

`prism-isogeny/src/jac.rs` ports Jacobian doubling and addition, and the
basis lift, from `src/ec/ref/lvlx/ec_jac.c` and `basis.c`.

`prism-isogeny/src/modular.rs` ports `complete_symplectic_matrix_dim2`
from `external/Theta_dim4` `pkg/basis_change/base_change_dim2.py`
(Apache-2.0, Pierrick Dartois). The Θ base-change and the isogeny chain
in that tree are not ported here.

`prism-isogeny/src/gluing.rs` and `prism-isogeny/src/chain.rs` port the
gluing isogeny and `_theta_chain_compute_impl` from `theta_isogenies.c`.
The signing-only randomisation of the final model is not included.

That code is Apache-2.0. Its authors, as named in those files, are
Antonin Leroux and the SQIsign authors. The PRISM_v2 repository
(https://github.com/mariascrs/PRISM_v2, commit
87fad7da5f12f79112521677f4f5530672afe9ba) carries the same license and
states that it is built on Qlapoti and the SQIsign reference.

